-- @record {"chapter":"board","data":{"constraints":"Start only when Paul asked for the work to run; a bot start also needs his approval. hold leaves both stored, dormant, visible on the board.","options":["start","hold"],"question":"Should these tasks be armed now, with these prompts, routes and the saved budget?"},"key":"arm-now","section":"judge"}
J arm-now start|hold:"Should these tasks be armed now, with these prompts, routes and the saved budget?" -- Start only when Paul asked for the work to run; a bot start also needs his approval. hold leaves both stored, dormant, visible on the board.
V J arm-now -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
-- @record {"chapter":"board","data":{"failure":"A dependent was created without its prerequisite (needs empty)","recovery":"Use nightshift.reparent with current expectedUpdatedAt. Edits disarm dormant tasks and refuse missing dependencies, cycles, running tasks and recorded attempts."},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X A dependent was created without its prerequisite (needs empty) -> Use nightshift.reparent with current expectedUpdatedAt. Edits disarm dormant tasks and refuse missing dependencies, cycles, running tasks and recorded attempts.
-- @record {"chapter":"board","data":{"failure":"Codex task that writes files stalls at launch on Windows","recovery":"Seen 2 Oct: codex-windows-sandbox-setup.exe stayed running and the run never started (likely a one-time elevated sandbox setup Paul must accept). Stop it from the board; until set up, use read-only prompts that answer in the reply and tick with run evidence"},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X Codex task that writes files stalls at launch on Windows -> Seen 2 Oct: codex-windows-sandbox-setup.exe stayed running and the run never started (likely a one-time elevated sandbox setup Paul must accept). Stop it from the board; until set up, use read-only prompts that answer in the reply and tick with run evidence
-- @record {"chapter":"board","data":{"failure":"Start all left a blocked task alone","recovery":"Blocked tasks restart one at a time from the board (Start again) after reading why"},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X Start all left a blocked task alone -> Blocked tasks restart one at a time from the board (Start again) after reading why
-- @record {"chapter":"board","data":{"failure":"Morning card shows a run that did not report tokens","recovery":"Its tokens are unknown, not zero; a harness token budget holds further launches until a new night"},"key":"3","section":"pitfalls"}
X Morning card shows a run that did not report tokens -> Its tokens are unknown, not zero; a harness token budget holds further launches until a new night
