-- @record {"chapter":"realbugs-lifecycle","section":"guidance","key":"1","data":"completionEvidence is the author-declared acceptance contract. file: path, optional contains/sha256/condition; commit: paths and optional hash/condition; receipt: path and expected top-level tool/result fields under expect (tool is required); result: read-only observer condition."}
M nightshift "completionEvidence is the author-declared acceptance contract. file: path, optional contains/sha256/condition; commit: paths and optional hash/condition; receipt: path and expected top-level tool/result fields under expect (tool is required); result: read-only observer condition." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"realbugs-lifecycle","section":"guidance","key":"2","data":"For launched file/receipt work, capture the declared output hash before dispatch and require new bytes. Commits must descend from the pre-attempt HEAD and change the declared paths. A receipt must be changed, successful, match expect, and equal the workspace saved native receipt with a valid receiptHash. Its timestamp and successful transcript tool call must belong to this attempt."}
M nightshift "For launched file/receipt work, capture the declared output hash before dispatch and require new bytes. Commits must descend from the pre-attempt HEAD and change the declared paths. A receipt must be changed, successful, match expect, and equal the workspace saved native receipt with a valid receiptHash. Its timestamp and successful transcript tool call must belong to this attempt." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"realbugs-lifecycle","section":"guidance","key":"3","data":"Stated results require nonempty assistant output from this attempt and a grounded read-only CL condition the verifier accepts. run evidence is accepted only with a nested verified output witness. Completion alone, old files, unrelated paths and failed observers cannot tick Done."}
M nightshift "Stated results require nonempty assistant output from this attempt and a grounded read-only CL condition the verifier accepts. run evidence is accepted only with a nested verified output witness. Completion alone, old files, unrelated paths and failed observers cannot tick Done." src:"authored manual" state:verified
